# 📌 Kubernetes Default Control Plane Components

When `kubeadm` initializes a cluster, Kubernetes automatically creates the core control plane components.

| Component               | Responsibility              |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------- |
| kube-apiserver          | Main Kubernetes API         |
| etcd                    | Cluster state database      |
| kube-scheduler          | Assigns pods to nodes       |
| kube-controller-manager | Runs Kubernetes controllers |
| kubelet                 | Node agent                  |
| kube-proxy              | Service networking          |
| CoreDNS                 | Cluster DNS                 |

---

# 🏗️ Kubernetes Architecture Flow

```text id="h2e4xw"
kubectl
    ↓
API Server
    ↓
etcd stores desired state
    ↓
Scheduler selects node
    ↓
kubelet receives instruction
    ↓
containerd pulls image
    ↓
Pod starts
```

