# 🏗️ Standard NGINX Deployment Manifest

```yaml id="o7qgse"
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment

metadata:
  name: nginx-deployment

spec:
  replicas: 2

  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nginx

  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nginx

    spec:
